 "strings": {
  "Whoa, can we slow down\nfor a second?": "",
  "No, we can't.\nLet's get this over with.": "",
  "No, we can't.\nLet's just do it already.": "",
  "Yeah, but, doing it right here?": "",
  "Well, that <font_kind=yakuza_italic>is</font_kind> tempting, but...": "",
  "Sorry!?": "",
  "Listen, you're very pretty, and you clearly\nknow what you're about, but...": "",
  "You're clearly the impulsive, passionate type.\nAnd that's totally fine!": "",
  "I'm more of a \"take it slow\" kinda guy, you know?\nI don't like to rush into these things...": "",
  "But I'm more of a \"take it slow\" guy myself.\nI mean, I barely know you...": "",
  "Yagami-kun!\nCan you seriously not tell it's me!?": "",
  "Wait. Who?": "",
  "Huh? Who?": "",
  "What the heck!? Mafuyu!?": "",
  "What the... Mafuyu!?": "",
  "I hate to break it to you, but when a woman comes on\nthat strong, she's not after what you think she is.": "",
  "I'm not exactly impulsive <font_kind=yakuza_italic>or</font_kind> passionate.\nSorry to break it to you.": "",
  "Right, uh... Anyway.\nWhat are you doing here?": "",
  "No, uh... Anyway,\nWhat are you doing here?": "",
  "I'm here on behalf of Ayabe.": "",
  "Wait, but... Really?\nWhy did Ayabe send you?": "",
  "You're... uh... Ayabe sent you?": "",
  "He gave me a call this morning out of the blue.\nSaid he needed me to help you in his stead.": "",
  "Here's the investigation report on Hashiki's murder.\nThis is what you want, right?": "",
  "Here's the report. All the info on Hashiki's murder.\nThis is what you want, right?": "",
  "You took it from the prosecutor's office?\nIsn't that, y'know... problematic?": "",
  "You took it from the prosecutor's office?\nIs that legal?": "",
  "Hence the disguise.\nThink it's okay to hand it over here?": "",
  "Hence the disguise.\nIs a hand-off too noticeable here?": "",
  "This is really intense.": "",
  "...I'm honestly pretty nervous.": "",
  "Try to stay calm.": "",
  "Don't overthink it.": "",
  "It's okay. Think of it as a thank you\nfor saving me yesterday.": "",
  "It's okay. Think of this as a thank you\nfor saving me yesterday.": "",
  "One more thing.\nRegarding Prosecutor Izumida.": "",
  "One more thing.\nIt's about Izumida-san.": "",
  "They're planning to arrest you under suspicion\nof murdering Shintani-sensei.": "",
  "They're planning to arrest you\nunder suspicion of murdering Shintani-sensei.": "",
  "I suggest you figure something out quick.": "",
  "Bye then.": "",
  "See you.": "",
  "Who was that?\nShe was smoking.": "",
  "Who was that?\nGirl was fine.": "",
  "That was Ayabe's replacement.": "",
  "Ayabe's replacement.": "",
  "Huh? What do we got here?": "",
  "Huh?\nWhat do we got here?": "",
  "This is... the investigation report.\nFrom Hashiki's murder.": "",
  "This is... the case file?\nFrom Hashiki's murder.": "",
  "Mafuyu stole it from the prosecutor's office.": "",
  "Mafuyu stole it from the\nprosecutor's office.": "",
  "Mafuyu-chan? \nAre you saying that woman was... her?": "",
  "Mafuyu-chan? Wait, you mean...\nThen that girl was...": "",
  "Yeah, I just made the same mistake...": "",
  "I just made the same mistake...": "",
  "You should check this stuff out, Tak.": "",
  "Hey. Take a look at this.\nWe've got Hashiki's whole bio.": "",
  "This is Hashiki's resume.\nLooks like he was pretty well-educated.": "",
  "They brought him on as\nvice director four years ago.": "",
  "They made him the ADDC's vice director\nfour years ago.": "",
  "Meaning he was already with the ADDC\nwhen you were busting your ass defending Okubo.": "",
  "Seems like he and Kido were responsible\nfor deciding how much money to give each project.": "",
  "So he and Kido handled funding allocation\nfor each project.": "",
  "Hashiki had more influence than I realized.": "",
  "Looks like Hashiki had more influence\nat the ADDC than I realized.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(And that's why Kajihira lured him over\nto his side.)</color>": "",
  "This here is a map of the crime scene.": "",
  "This here is a map\nof the crime scene.": "",
  "Hashiki was found lying here.": "",
  "An hour before that,\nhe was seen drinking at a cabaret.": "",
  "This one.\nPlace called the Queen Rouge.": "",
  "There. This club's the one.\nPlace called the Queen Rouge.": "",
  "They charge an arm and a leg,\nbut hell if they don't make bank off it.": "",
  "They charge an arm and a leg,\nbut they sure make bank off it.": "",
  "Was Hashiki drinking alone\nwhile he was there?": "",
  "And Hashiki? He was drinking alone\nat the Queen Rouge?": "",
  "Naw, looks like one of his colleagues\nwas with him.": "",
  "Wait...\nIt was that guy, Shono!": "",
  "Huh? Wait, it was that guy Shono!": "",
  "So the two of them came all the way\nfrom the Center just to grab a few drinks.": "",
  "So Hashiki came all the way from the Center\njust to grab a few drinks.": "",
  "The question is, why?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Shono's the lead researcher on AD-9.\nHe seems to report to Kido.)</color>": "",
  "After they left the club,\nShono grabbed a cab by himself.": "",
  "After they left the club, Shono parted ways\nwith Hashiki and grabbed a taxi by himself.": "",
  "He claims he went back to the Center\nand had a chat with Kido.": "",
  "Apparently went back to the Center\nand had a chat with Kido.": "",
  "The taxi company's records back that up.": "",
  "Meaning Shono has an alibi.\nKido, too.": "",
  "Meaning Shono has a solid alibi.\nAnd Kido's covered, too.": "",
  "Yup. As for Hashiki, he had an argument\nwith a man in a black raincoat...": "",
  "Yup. As for Hashiki, he had an argument\noutside the taxi with a man in a black raincoat...": "",
  "Then they found him on the ground,\nshit beat outta him.": "",
  "Then they found him out cold and bleeding\nin an alleyway.": "",
  "Three weeks later, he was dead.": "",
  "That's horrible.": "",
  "Cause of death was a cerebral contusion\ndue to blunt trauma.": "",
  "Cause of death was cerebral contusion\ndue to blunt trauma.": "",
  "The culprit hit him fourteen, maybe fifteen times.\n No fingerprints, so he must've been wearing gloves.": "",
  "The culprit hit him fourteen, maybe fifteen times.\nNo fingerprints, so he must've been wearing gloves.": "",
  "All right. I think we\nunderstand how it all went down.": "",
  "I think we understand how it all\nwent down, now.": "",
  "So what's our next move?": "",
  "So? What's our next move?": "",
  "I wanna take a little field trip.\nSee for ourselves where they found Hashiki.": "",
  "The Queen Rouge is right near there, too.": "",
  "The Queen Rouge is\nright near there, too.": "",
  "Kaito-san.\nMind playing the part of Hashiki?": "",
  "Guess not.\nHe was 'round here, yeah?": "",
  "Sure.\nHe was 'round here, yeah?": "",
  "How's this?": "",
  "Wow, you look so... lifeless.\nYou could get a job doing this.": "",
  "Very nice.\nI think you've found your calling.": "",
  "Oh shut up.": "",
  "Okay, so. Six months ago,\njust past 11 PM.": "",
  "Okay, so.\nSix months ago, just past 11 PM.": "",
  "Hashiki and Shono finish drinking. Shono gets in a cab,\nHashiki stays and argues with a man in a raincoat.": "",
  "When they finish drinking, Shono gets in a taxi,\nHashiki stays and argues with a man in a raincoat.": "",
  "After which he was found here,\nbeaten half to death.": "",
  "But Shono got in the cab on Showa Street.": "",
  "But Shono got in the taxi\non Showa Street.": "",
  "Meaning Hashiki and his friend went somewhere\nelse just so they could have their little scuffle.": "",
  "Meaning Hashiki and his friend\ntook their beef all the way here.": "",
  "It's definitely quieter here.": "",
  "Maybe this is always where\nthe murderer planned to kill Hashiki.": "",
  "Maybe this is where the murderer\nplanned to kill Hashiki all along.": "",
  "And what makes you say that?": "",
  "I dunno, just a hunch.": "",
  "I dunno. Detective's intuition.": "",
  "Big mister detective...": "",
  "Oh, big mister detective!": "",
  "Anyway, think we got all we can.\nNothing's gonna be left from six months ago.": "",
  "I think that's all we got, Tak. It's been six months.\nWe're not gonna find much left here.": "",
  "Yeah, you're right.": "",
  "Yeah. Fair enough.": "",
  "The Queen Rouge...": "",
  "So even stuffy, honest scientists\ncome to places like this.": "",
  "Hashiki wasn't exactly honest.\nOr a scientist.": "",
  "Shono aside, Hashiki wasn't\nexactly honest.": "",
  "Guy was on Kajihira's payroll, remember?": "",
  "He was was Kajihira's spy,\nremember?": "",
  "Looks like they're not open yet.\nHope someone's in there.": "",
  "...Looks like they're not open yet.\nHope someone's in there.": "",
  "Where you going, Tak?": "",
  "Hey, where you goin'?": "",
  "C'mon, we gotta check out the Queen Rouge.\nSee what Shono and Hashiki were talking about, y'know.": "",
  "Hello? Is anyone here?": "",
  "'Scuse me?\nIs anyone here?": "",
  "We're not open yet, sir.\nMay I ask who you are?": "",
  "I must also point out that this club\nis members only.": "",
  "I must also point out that this club\nis for members only.": "",
  "Oh, uh... you know a Hashiki?\nFrom the ADDC?": "",
  "Oh, uh... you know a Hashiki-san,\nfrom the ADDC?": "",
  "He told us to stop by.": "",
  "Hashiki-san?": "",
  "Sorry, I've never heard of him. All recommendations\nmust come from a current member.": "",
  "Afraid not, sir. All recommendations\nmust come from a current member.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I'm not gonna let this guy\nplay dumb with me.)</color>": "",
  "You know Hashiki-san's dead, right?": "",
  "He got beaten to death six months ago.\nRight after leaving your club.": "",
  "He got beaten to death six months ago,\nright after leaving your club.": "",
  "...Who are you?\nYou're clearly not cops.": "",
  "We're private investigators,\nYagami Detective Agency.": "",
  "We're private investigators in Kamurocho.\nFrom the Yagami Detective Agency.": "",
  "We wanna know what happened that night.": "",
  "We wanna know what happened\nthat night.": "",
  "You think I'm a goddamn elephant, man?\nI can't remember something from that long ago.": "",
  "The hell do you want, man?\nI can't remember shit from that far back.": "",
  "We don't need you to tell us.": "",
  "Well, it's not your story\nwe need to hear.": "",
  "You have girls working here, yeah?": "",
  "You have lots of girls\nworking tables here, right?": "",
  "If possible, I'd like to talk to the girl\nwho sat with Hashiki-san.": "",
  "Get out of my face.\nI have no obligation to help you.": "",
  "Go whine at someone else.\nI got no reason to help you.": "",
  "How 'bout this. I'll talk to you once you're a member.\nIf you can get a recommendation, that is.": "",
  "How 'bout you come back with a membership,\nrecommendation and all.": "",
  "Lemme say, though... Our rates aren't\nexactly what I would call cheap.": "",
  "But... you probably oughta know,\nour rates aren't exactly cheap.": "",
  "I don't have time to go hunt\ndown a recommendation.": "",
  "I don't have time to hunt down\na recommendation.": "",
  "Then get out of my face.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Ugh, I can't afford to waste time with this crap.)</color>": "",
  "Hold on, you guys're recruiting?": "",
  "Hey. Says here...\nyou guys're recruiting?": "",
  "Think this girl fits the bill?\nPretty damn fine, huh?": "",
  "Well, think this girl fits the bill?\nPretty hot, right?": "",
  "Hmm, well, she's not bad, I guess.": "",
  "Enh... I guess so.\nShe's not bad.": "",
  "Not bad?": "",
  "Not bad!?": "",
  "You, my friend,\nhave impossibly high standards.": "",
  "<font_kind=yakuza_italic>She's not bad?</font_kind>\nYou got some high standards.": "",
  "Look, we only go for the hottest chicks.\nThat's how we rake in the big bucks.": "",
  "But there's more to being hot than just looks.\nYou gotta have something extra. Some charm, y'know?": "",
  "But there's more to being hot than just looks.\nYou gotta have a little extra oomph, some charm.": "",
  "What the hell are you doing, Kaito-san?\nMafuyu's gonna be pissed.": "",
  "If you can think of a better way,\nbe my guest.": "",
  "All Mafuyu's gotta do is get hired and find out\nwhat Shono and Hashiki were talking about.": "",
  "If she gets hired,\nwe'll get our story.": "",
  "Don't be an idiot.\nWe can't ask her to do that.": "",
  "Hmm. In that case...": "",
  "Hmm. Then...": "",
  "How about her?": "",
  "Saori-san? She wouldn't stand more\nof a chance than Mafuyu did.": "",
  "Saori-san? Don't be ridiculous!\nShe couldn't do any better than Mafuyu!": "",
  "Who else do we got?": "",
  "Whoa, whoa, who's that?\nNow there's a girl I wanna see.": "",
  "Whoa, who's <font_kind=yakuza_italic>that</font_kind>?\nNow there's a girl I wanna see.": "",
  "That photo's not doing her any favors...\nBut polish her up and she'll shine like a diamond.": "",
  "That photo's not doing her any favors...\nbut she's good. A diamond in the rough.": "",
  "Trust me, boys.": "",
  "Trust me.": "",
  "See what I mean?\nEven Hoshino-kun's got the hots for her.": "",
  "Hoshino-kun's always raving about\nhow pretty she is. Can't shut him up, either.": "",
  "You run this club, yeah?": "",
  "That's right. Please, bring that\nfriend of yours over here.": "",
  "Yeah. Bring that\nfriend of yours by.": "",
  "I wanna see her for myself.\nHell, I'll hire her on the spot.": "",
  "I think we can manage that. C'mon, Tak.": "",
  "I think we can manage that. See you later.\nLet's go, Tak.": "",
  "Ugh...": "",
  "Come on...": "",
  "I'll be waiting!": "",
  "I'll be waiting, you two!": "",
  "Well, looks like we're sending\nSaori-san in there.": "",
  "Well, looks like Saori-san\nis going undercover.": "",
  "It's the quickest way.": "",
  "No quicker way about it!": "",
  "Easier said than done.\nHow are we even gonna get her on board?": "",
  "Easier said than done.\nHow do we get Saori-san on board?": "",
  "I dunno. She likes dessert, right?\nJust give her something sweet and call it a day.": "",
  "I dunno. She likes food, right?\nJust give her something sweet and call it a day.": "",
  "You think she'd really go for that?\nI bring sweets to the office all the time.": "",
  "You think she'd really go for that!?\nI bring sweets to the office all the time.": "",
  "Sounds to me like you're gonna need the Kaito of desserts.\nA dessert to crush all other desserts.": "",
  "There you go. You just gotta find something better!\nThe dessert to crush all desserts.": "",
  "Oh yeah?\nWhat'd you have in mind?": "",
  "...What did you have in mind?": "",
  "Do I look like a dessert menu?\nThis is all you, buddy.": "",
  "Oh, I got no clue.\nYou're the guy with the hookups.": "",
  "It was your idea, jackass...": "",
  "Hey, this whole thing was <font_kind=yakuza_italic>your</font_kind> idea!": "",
  "(The dessert to crush all others?)": "",
  "(I thought the ones before were damn good, though...\nMaybe I should ask for some help.)": "",
  "(I bet Mafuyu would know\nwhat kinda sweets Saori-san likes.)": "",
  "(I don't know how I'd even begin\nto explain it to her, though.)": "",
  "(After she got that file for us, too...\nI don't want to saddle her with more of this.)": "",
  "(But who else would be able to help...?)": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "See you.": "ไว้เจอกัน",
  "That's horrible.": "นั่นมันโหดร้ายมากเลยนะ",
  "How's this?": "แบบนี้เป็นไงคะ?",
  "And what makes you say that?": "อะไรทำให้แกพูดแบบนั้นวะ?",
  "Yeah, you're right.": "ใช่ นายพูดถูก",
  "Trust me.": "เชื่อกูเถอะ",
  "Ugh...": "อึก...",
  "Come on...": "มาเลย...",
  "I'll be waiting!": "ผมจะรอนะครับ!"
 }
}
